DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-01T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-01T09:45:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nSUFFRAGETTE LINE: Sunday 1 November\, until 0945\, no service between Gospel Oak and Woodgrange Park. Use local buses between South Tottenham and Barking via all reasonable routes or London Underground Victoria line (entrance/exit at Seven Sisters\, Tottenham Hale\, Blackhorse Road and Walthamstow Central stations) via any reasonable route\; London Underground Central line (entrance/exit at Leyton and Leytonstone stations) via any reasonable route\; or London Underground District / Hammersmith & City line (entrance/exit at East Ham and Barking) via any reasonable route. First through trains: Gospel Oak to Barking Riverside 1009\; Barking Riverside to Gospel Oak 0933
DTEND:20261101T094500Z
DTSTART:20261101T043000Z
SUMMARY:Suffragette line: Part Closure
UID:21192bb4-8e0c-408a-931d-a65257cdd45c@2119.org
END:VEVENT
